{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"title":"rejectionReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/RejectionReport":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Events a tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared on it: the event’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"name, the property and the keyword it broke, how many were rejected and when they were tracked.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":